ti-monitor during  the crisis on infinite earth's event  superboy battles alongside heroes from  other earth to defeat him and once the  anti-monitor is vanquished superboy goes  to a paradise dimension along with earth  2 versions of superman and lois lane  as well as alexander luther the son of  lex luthor from earth 3. now while in  this dimension  superboy prime never actually ages but  becomes embittered by the fact that he  was robbed of his childhood  and would never grow up to fulfill his  destiny of becoming superman he also  comes to hate the new earth version of  superboy connor kent for filling the  role  that he felt was rightfully his and so  during his many years in this pocket  dimension just getting madder in matter  alexander luther decides that they've  all had enough and they're going to make  their way to the dc universe and so  superboy prime starts punching the  barrier between the two realities which  not only causes the barrier to break  down  but also sends ripple effects throughout  reality altering it in several ways such  as bringing dead characters back to life  furthermore he proves himself to be  powerful enough to alter the orbits of  planets as well as change the location  of the center of the universe  not only was super boy prime able to  best martian manhunter a character on  par with superman in terms of power but  was also able to punch his way out of  the phantom zone which up to that point  was thought to be impossible  and which once again set reality  altering ripple effects throughout the  universe he's also said to be faster  than wally west who's considered to be  the fastest of all the speedsters at the  time  and was able to free himself from the  speed force despite being exposed to  constant red sun radiation which  dampened his powers  during his time in the speed force his  powers are augmented even further as he  created a conduit for himself that  captured and stored the energy of yellow  suns from which his powers are derived  following this he was able to easily  defeat the combined forces of the  justice society the teen titans the  justice league and the doom patrol and  so it should be clear by now that  superboy prime is not only one of the  strongest versions of superman that's  ever existed but is also  one of the most powerful characters in  all of comics and so with that in mind  the question becomes how do we kill him  well  first we need to address two major ways  that will not be successful because  superboy prime is a version of superman  it might seem obvious to use superman's  traditional weakness against him the  most widely known weakness of superman  is of course  kryptonite you could ask anyone that has  never even picked up a comic book  and they could likely tell you that  kryptonite is superman's weakness it's  that ingrained in pop culture but while  kryptonite does have devastating effects  on superman  superboy prime does not share that  weakness the reason for this is that in  his universe  there were no fragments of his home  planet krypton that survived the  destruction of the planet and the  fragments of krypton from other  universes are not harmful to him and so  kryptonite is not going to help us  in any way another weakness of  superman's is magic there have been  countless times throughout history that  this has been exploited and is well  established to be a part of his  character but once again  this information is useless in our  attempt to take out superboy prime  because he does not share this weakness  either we have to remember that superboy  prime comes from earth prime which is  the analog to our world so just like in  our world  magic does not exist there and so  superboy prime is not going to be  vulnerable against it  and so that's off the table as well now  simply overwhelming superboy prime is  also  not likely to give us the result that we  want when one of the guardians of the  universe tried to destroy himself  by self-destructing superboy prime  simply absorbed the resulting energy  and it only made it more powerful at  least powerful enough to destroy an  entire universe and kidnapped mr mixol  pitilic one of the strongest reality  warpers in dc comics and so we can't  just produce a powerful enough attack to  take him out either and so we're going  to have to figure out some weakness to  exploit now if you were paying attention  earlier  i mentioned that when superboy prime was  stuck in the speed force he was  constantly being exposed to red sun  radiation which dampened his powers  however  this did not seem to be overly effective  since he was able  to not only survive but build a suit  that harnessed yellow sun energy  and escaped the speed force which also  would have been impossible but i think  that clues us in to our answer here and  that is  for that as powerful as superboy prime  is he still relies on yellow sun energy  to survive and so we're going to need to  find a way  to cut him off from the supply of stored  yellow sun energy that a suit provides  and we're also going to have to block  his access to any additional sunlight  if we can do those two things he should  theoretically be no harder to kill than  the average person since kryptonians do  not have superpowers on krypton  due to the absence of a yellow sun  nearby and so i think that's our best  bet we're going to have to disrupt his  connection  with his power suit and also find a way  to block the sun's radiation from  reaching the battlefield  in order to be successful but let me  know what you guys think right if you  can think of a better way  to take out superboy prime let me know  down in the comment section if you guys  are new here to comments explain make  sure you guys hit the sub button to  become part of the rob core if you guys  enjoyed this video  make sure you drop a like and i will  catch you all later  peace  you

